# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

pnpm-lock.yaml
# package-lock.json is committed on purpose: it is the only thing that
# pins transitive dependencies, so CI installs the same tree that was
# reviewed and scanned rather than resolving fresh on every run.

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

